{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2860037e401be47e211d04bb7b0c598cf5ffd31335cd57296c510339da6798c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2962bd03062b0429e40949230abdadb4b4aee699bca0154025e19c7e2a17b3ee",
      "text": "庆祝就要用惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83ed68026d9e08487639704d0516c618b12f47b939f05be78999231efc87b72",
      "text": "马上就是隼人的生日了，四季等人计划举办一场惊喜派对。虽然瞒着隼人立即开始做准备，但面对与往常不同的成员们的表现，隼人却察觉到了异样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2962bd03062b0429e40949230abdadb4b4aee699bca0154025e19c7e2a17b3ee",
      "text": "庆祝就要用惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9994a404281bf3c93c33cb05482f1e057012c1dcaea2d23b1a43fb54e2333ab",
      "text": "锵锵！\n突击提问时间！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae9946b4d17d642d9b40a9008dc7d28003f851fa20fa892b97aaf9a53c18f04d",
      "text": "11月22日是什么日子呢！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1133d4f75ab3b45f30304a0e6a9dfa6a305fcab776f750d5d8ff6579c501ce5a",
      "text": "……汪汪喵喵之日……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c587c9a2032dec22edf6329169e719eb899c912f80f0a083285b37d22f105b03",
      "text": "是小测验的日子呢。\n四季君，你有好好学习吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9109d70a15e9735acabbe1ef442fccfce4746f56b29cb916384a58ea2200d9da",
      "text": "咯噔！\n嘟、嘟——！两个人都回答错误！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5422d169c859553da5acc230644b0d94a7e7c3ef218e34ea208ed23511ea372b",
      "text": "哈哈，其实你们两个都心知肚明吧。\n是隼人的生日对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8516ea92c00d46dcec5900652fc1839eb6a7646c6c3fa689fd0f93aac14899",
      "text": "春名亲～不愧是你！\n说到生日，那要做的事情就只有一件了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78625bdd9b55aa2e92ed39b09fd6f8693e1888767d9f88ed68bb3bc0642ab097",
      "text": "大家一起准备派对，\n给隼人亲一个超级大惊喜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf4472048172efa871cacfde8c1d0cc1d047bb6c9e729d7a2a44b60b0c0d8a11",
      "text": "惊喜派对……真不错呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29f44f6ac3c69d28ffa5def3bea536e4a8d87a9da5542b1de9ade2e98e7a2d73",
      "text": "就是说嘛！难得的机会，\n也让●●●●プロデューサー一起帮忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e462d70cb7f8437d82a3f2f97f229175c73005d5ae3ee0f5492632f7d87fcba1",
      "text": "我回来啦！社长会议开得好长……\n哎，大家在聊什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77ada17ac8e03050cd760738bd48a544dd56c5e7019c4d445107d9a83ab7ed0",
      "text": "……秘密。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917a688ba45147b40c1fd0b316d04e24382bd266f579189cfc9392e26185f705",
      "text": "诶——！好在意啊快告诉我啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b306834e34d7759c611348231fd8dbf119039e1eb20db29f0056b748075584e1",
      "text": "没什么大不了的。只是在聊\n让四季君去备考复习的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c7add1320a57a9ebcd6ff000c77483df11bbedfc105ab3f1c7549fd2c0e6e5",
      "text": "哇啊——！\n听不见听不见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8ea6b18d4a801e522ddf4b322a8943937cb6a36f70f6f504d7248fd65ae1f1",
      "text": "哈哈……四季还是老样子啊。\n那么，我们开始练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_a:cmd-000215:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e875a26e6efa9aee57467f129e845f7f25965e0d87d7a08f0b7b20c7e422fa",
      "text": "噢。\n今天也充满干劲地上吧——",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
